WEBVTT

00:01.830 --> 00:04.130
After learning all about Helck's past,

00:04.130 --> 00:07.330
Vermilio makes a renewed pledge
to fight by his side.

00:07.330 --> 00:08.420
Not long after,

00:08.420 --> 00:12.880
they are found by a member of the Empire's
search & rescue team named Harpey.

00:13.290 --> 00:16.080
And she delivers a message
to them from Azudra.

00:35.500 --> 00:38.040
Aa, touzen mitai ni tsuyosa kazashite

00:38.040 --> 00:40.210
Noudo mashiteku rettoukanjou

00:40.210 --> 00:42.170
Umareta toki kara

00:42.170 --> 00:44.330
Kimatterutte oshietoite yo

00:44.330 --> 00:46.080
Risoukyou no otonari san

00:46.080 --> 00:48.290
Zetsubou ga sa hora "konnichiwa"

00:48.290 --> 00:50.330
Daremo kizukanai no wa

00:50.330 --> 00:52.500
Kou ka fukou ka?

00:52.500 --> 00:55.710
Nando mezamete mo

00:55.710 --> 00:58.830
Akumu no you dana

00:58.830 --> 01:02.210
Kurushii dake nara

01:02.580 --> 01:04.380
Kamisama douka boku o tsukurikaete kuranai ka

01:04.380 --> 01:08.290
Kamisama douka boku o tsukurikaete kuranai ka

01:08.290 --> 01:10.420
Aa, nanmannen mo bokura wa

01:10.420 --> 01:13.000
Mirai ni kibou idakinagara

01:13.000 --> 01:14.880
Douse otozureru ketsumatsu ni

01:14.880 --> 01:17.170
Aragou to surun da

01:17.170 --> 01:18.830
Nankai me no inori da

01:18.830 --> 01:21.170
Kokoro karada kawari hatete

01:21.170 --> 01:25.580
Magamono datte nan datte shinjitakute

01:25.710 --> 01:29.080
Are, boku wa ima ikiteru no?

01:29.080 --> 01:31.830
Mou wake wakannai ya

01:31.830 --> 01:33.830
Helck me tasukete yo

01:47.080 --> 01:52.000
<b>The Mysterious Woman</b>

02:12.290 --> 02:15.170
These demons are so friggin' strong
it's ridiculous.

02:15.170 --> 02:18.250
We're lucky the human race didn't get
wiped out before the awakening happened.

02:18.250 --> 02:21.170
I can't believe these freaks have been
our neighbors this whole time.

02:21.170 --> 02:22.580
It sends chills down my spine.

02:22.580 --> 02:23.880
We're joining the assault!

02:23.880 --> 02:25.000
Don't get taken prisoner!

02:25.710 --> 02:27.080
You don't have to tell me.

02:29.080 --> 02:30.830
Yo! Hear me out.

02:30.830 --> 02:32.670
What do you say we just stop fighting?

02:32.920 --> 02:34.880
There's nothing fun about
killing each other!

02:34.880 --> 02:36.250
Let's be buddies instead!

02:36.580 --> 02:37.710
Not a chance!

02:37.710 --> 02:40.710
Who in their right mind could sleep
peacefully next to an empire of monsters?!

02:40.710 --> 02:42.580
Humanity can never know true peace

02:42.580 --> 02:44.750
until we overcome the massive gap
in strength between us!

02:44.750 --> 02:46.790
Oh, come on.
You guys are immortal, right?

02:46.790 --> 02:47.920
Shut up!

02:47.920 --> 02:49.040
Yeesh.

02:49.710 --> 02:50.710
What about Helck?

02:50.710 --> 02:52.920
I'm pretty sure he's against
all this warmongering.

02:54.130 --> 02:57.000
Keep his name out of your mouth!
Dammit!

02:57.460 --> 02:59.830
I loathe all demonkin
from the bottom of my heart!

02:59.830 --> 03:02.790
Especially the ones
who are insolent jokers like you!

03:02.790 --> 03:04.670
Wow. We actually agree on something.

03:07.630 --> 03:09.080
Hyura!

03:09.080 --> 03:11.210
I share a similar loathing for you humans.

03:11.210 --> 03:13.210
Along with idiots like Kenros.

03:13.210 --> 03:14.670
Hey, that's not nice.

03:16.290 --> 03:19.040
There are many different races
that live in our Empire.

03:19.330 --> 03:21.710
And yeah, some of them
are full of stupid shitheads.

03:21.710 --> 03:23.460
But as far as I know,

03:23.460 --> 03:26.500
you humans are WAY bigger shitheads
than any of them.

03:26.500 --> 03:28.210
The shittiest pieces of shit!

03:28.210 --> 03:29.790
There's nothing more scummy

03:29.790 --> 03:32.580
than you guys pretending that all
your wrongdoing is somehow justified.

03:32.580 --> 03:34.710
I don't think the world will ever see

03:34.710 --> 03:37.080
another race as offensively
shameless as humankind!

03:37.080 --> 03:39.420
Lady Hyura kicks so much ass!

03:39.420 --> 03:42.960
But actually, there's something about
your people that I hate above all else.

03:43.710 --> 03:44.670
And that's...

03:45.460 --> 03:46.750
how weak you are!

03:48.670 --> 03:51.710
I hate weak men with a passion.

03:54.880 --> 03:56.130
Dammit...

03:56.130 --> 03:59.040
I'm going to kill you someday.
I'll tear you limb from limb!

03:59.040 --> 04:00.750
You can bet on it!

04:01.000 --> 04:02.460
I will kill you.

04:03.130 --> 04:05.040
I'm getting real tired
of hearing you say that.

04:05.040 --> 04:07.500
Hyura! Don't let him commit suicide!
Capture him!

04:07.500 --> 04:08.830
I know.

04:09.830 --> 04:10.710
Huh?

04:18.040 --> 04:20.460
They just showed up out of nowhere again!

04:22.710 --> 04:25.040
I'll get you next time...

04:25.670 --> 04:29.040
Next time... you're dead meat...

04:31.130 --> 04:34.250
Even though we know he's not really dead,
it's still sickening to watch.

04:34.250 --> 04:35.210
Ya know?

04:37.380 --> 04:38.670
Pitiful.

04:41.170 --> 04:43.080
Create a diversion?

04:43.080 --> 04:46.540
But we're not even sure
that we can find Lady Vermilio!

04:46.710 --> 04:48.710
I told you, that's just plan A.

04:48.710 --> 04:51.250
I have other plans up my sleeve
where you're the leading man, Hon.

04:51.250 --> 04:51.960
Huh?

04:51.960 --> 04:52.630
Just kidding.

04:52.630 --> 04:53.630
Huh?!

04:53.630 --> 04:55.250
But all things considered,

04:55.250 --> 04:59.000
if we have to fight against undying
enemies with our limited number of troops,

04:59.000 --> 05:01.500
then plan A is our best option.

05:01.500 --> 05:02.920
F-fair enough,

05:02.920 --> 05:06.080
but isn't having a main force consisting
of only two people a little too small?

05:06.080 --> 05:08.000
It has its advantages.

05:08.000 --> 05:10.920
Besides, those two are far
from just ordinary soldiers.

05:10.920 --> 05:12.750
You know that, right?

05:12.750 --> 05:15.330
So, you're already counting Helck
as part of our team, huh?

05:15.330 --> 05:17.210
I get where you're coming from,

05:17.210 --> 05:19.540
but what happens if it takes
a long time for the search party

05:19.540 --> 05:20.830
to find Lady Vermilio?

05:20.830 --> 05:23.500
Not to mention, we can't be sure if Helck
is still traveling with her.

05:23.750 --> 05:27.130
I've put together a list of warriors
who can act as replacements.

05:27.130 --> 05:30.210
So if it comes down to it,
we'll just send them instead.

05:30.210 --> 05:32.330
I get why you're itching to take action,

05:32.330 --> 05:33.670
but using a strategy like this

05:33.670 --> 05:35.920
means there are no second chances
if we fail the first time.

05:35.920 --> 05:39.670
Which is why we're going with the plan
that's most likely to succeed.

05:39.920 --> 05:42.630
However, there's another layer to it.

05:42.790 --> 05:45.080
We convince them
we can't afford to strike back,

05:45.080 --> 05:48.630
because they'll let their guard down
if they think we're on the ropes.

05:48.630 --> 05:51.830
And that will boost the success rate
of plan A even higher.

05:51.830 --> 05:53.080
Great idea!

05:53.080 --> 05:55.880
Except we've been trouncing them
in every fight so far...

05:56.250 --> 05:58.920
Well, there's a nagging concern
I have about that.

05:58.920 --> 06:00.330
What do you mean?

06:00.580 --> 06:03.830
I've been sensing a strange presence
nearby for some time now.

06:03.830 --> 06:07.170
I'm pretty sure it's a human,
but one we don't want to mess with.

06:07.170 --> 06:08.330
What?!

06:08.330 --> 06:11.580
Are you saying one of them
has powered up enough to be a threat?

06:11.580 --> 06:13.040
I'm not sure.

06:13.040 --> 06:15.920
Actually, it must be someone
who was strong from the get-go.

06:17.130 --> 06:18.040
Hon.

06:18.670 --> 06:22.130
You know how powerful
Demon Lord Urum was, right?

06:22.130 --> 06:24.960
Do you really think
he could have been defeated so easily,

06:24.960 --> 06:27.330
even if the humans
had awakened their hero powers?

06:27.330 --> 06:28.830
No.

06:29.040 --> 06:30.540
There must be another human

06:30.540 --> 06:32.580
aside from Helck with enough power
to pose a threat to us.

06:32.920 --> 06:34.460
Plus, even with immortality,

06:34.460 --> 06:36.420
the way the humans
just throw themselves at us

06:36.420 --> 06:38.040
without any real strategy is very odd.

06:38.040 --> 06:42.790
In any case, my instincts are telling me
that we shouldn't make a move right now.

06:42.790 --> 06:46.000
There's a good chance we obtain
some new information in the meantime.

06:46.000 --> 06:49.130
We'll just have to wait
to hear more from Agent Asta.

06:51.170 --> 06:52.290
Asta...

06:55.750 --> 06:57.960
It feels like everyone's hopes
are riding on my shoulders!

06:58.170 --> 07:00.420
Okay! I'm gonna give it my all today, too!

07:01.210 --> 07:05.330
Quite a lot of time has passed
since I first infiltrated the human realm.

07:05.330 --> 07:07.920
The fact I've been able
to go undiscovered for so long

07:07.920 --> 07:10.210
is a testament to my
advanced skills as a spy.

07:10.210 --> 07:11.920
Well, I wish I could brag like that...

07:11.920 --> 07:15.170
but the truth is that the conditions
here just worked in my favor.

07:15.170 --> 07:19.080
For starters, this place has tons of
different escape routes and areas to hide.

07:19.080 --> 07:21.920
The castle interior is filled
with various hallways and doors

07:21.920 --> 07:25.210
that are impossible for the winged knights
to even pass through.

07:25.630 --> 07:28.000
Secondly, there's an abundance
of food supplies nearby.

07:28.000 --> 07:32.170
Although, the only edible things left now
are those with a longer shelf life.

07:32.380 --> 07:34.380
Thirdly, the security is very lax.

07:34.380 --> 07:37.080
Like, it's so poor that I wonder why
they even bother with it.

07:38.130 --> 07:41.000
Anyway, despite how convenient
the situation is,

07:41.000 --> 07:43.960
gathering intel has proven to be
a serious uphill battle.

07:43.960 --> 07:47.920
That's because the number of humans who
are capable of speech is incredibly low.

07:50.420 --> 07:52.630
I gotta say, the quality
of the castle's construction

07:52.630 --> 07:54.750
is leagues better than
anything else around here.

07:54.750 --> 07:57.500
It's on par with the upscale buildings
that we have in the Imperial Capital.

07:58.170 --> 08:00.080
Oh yeah, that reminds me.

08:00.080 --> 08:02.460
I've heard the humans
waged war against each other

08:02.460 --> 08:04.960
for thousands of years
over control of this castle.

08:06.210 --> 08:07.330
Someone's coming!

08:07.330 --> 08:09.080
I didn't think any humans came down here!

08:09.080 --> 08:10.130
C-crap!

08:10.130 --> 08:11.580
They're gonna find me!

08:12.210 --> 08:13.710
Yeah, right.

08:14.920 --> 08:17.960
Just gotta stay calm.
And keep moving.

08:18.460 --> 08:20.830
It's fine, nothing to worry about.

08:21.040 --> 08:23.040
Uh oh! Not good! Not good!

08:23.040 --> 08:25.750
There are no narrow hallways!

08:30.670 --> 08:32.830
Did that woman take you down again?

08:32.830 --> 08:37.000
I hate to say it, but she's still beyond
my skill level at this point.

08:37.000 --> 08:37.960
Oh?

08:37.960 --> 08:39.580
It's some knights who can talk.

08:41.420 --> 08:43.540
Spy item: Hearing Gum.

08:43.540 --> 08:46.080
It boosts the user's auditory
perception for a few minutes.

08:46.080 --> 08:49.040
However, it has no real effect on Asta
because her ears are already very sharp.

08:49.040 --> 08:51.040
It's purely a psychological thing.

08:52.330 --> 08:54.460
It's almost time to shift into phase 2.

08:54.710 --> 08:55.960
You might end up being sent over

08:55.960 --> 08:58.000
to the Demon Lord's castle
on the south side instead.

08:58.000 --> 08:59.460
Such is life.

08:59.460 --> 09:01.630
We're nothing but pawns
of the king, after all.

09:01.630 --> 09:03.380
Following his orders is all I can do.

09:03.380 --> 09:04.630
True.

09:04.790 --> 09:06.330
The southern side?

09:06.330 --> 09:08.630
So they're going
to attack Castle Shin, too...

09:09.330 --> 09:12.710
Why bother getting hung up
on defeating one stupid demon?

09:12.710 --> 09:15.710
Because after we reach the final phase,
they're all gonna...

09:15.710 --> 09:16.710
Stop!

09:16.960 --> 09:18.040
What's wrong?

09:18.040 --> 09:19.250
Is there an intruder?

09:19.250 --> 09:20.330
I don't know.

09:20.330 --> 09:23.040
But can't you feel something in the air?

09:23.040 --> 09:24.790
Huh? Not at all.

09:24.790 --> 09:26.580
Our security is perfect.

09:26.580 --> 09:29.830
None of those damn demons
could have wormed their way in here.

09:29.830 --> 09:31.130
Don't sell them so short.

09:31.130 --> 09:33.250
It seemed like they had
somehow gotten information

09:33.250 --> 09:34.920
about our plans once before, remember?

09:34.920 --> 09:38.040
So don't blab about the details
of our strategy out in the open.

09:38.040 --> 09:39.290
Fine then.

09:39.290 --> 09:40.290
Shoot.

09:40.290 --> 09:41.920
Let's play it safe and do
a sweep of the surrounding area.
But I got some new info anyway!<b></b>

09:41.920 --> 09:42.830
Let's play it safe and do
a sweep of the surrounding area.
I need to hurry and let Ista-<b></b>

09:42.830 --> 09:45.080
Remember that rats
like to hide in tight spaces.

09:45.080 --> 09:46.210
Oh, crud!

09:47.000 --> 09:48.580
What a pain in the ass.

09:48.580 --> 09:49.750
Screw it!

09:49.750 --> 09:53.630
Then I'm just gonna unload a burst of my
magic into every kind of hole that I see!

09:54.750 --> 09:56.920
Don't! Are you trying
to destroy the whole castle?!

09:56.920 --> 09:58.250
Stop acting like a moron!

09:58.250 --> 10:00.250
Tsk! Whatever.

10:01.500 --> 10:03.080
Aw jeez, gimme a break!

10:13.540 --> 10:15.210
Man, that was scary!

10:16.790 --> 10:19.460
The heck is this stuff? It's all squishy!

10:37.330 --> 10:39.460
What's the deal with this guy?

10:40.540 --> 10:41.920
Is he human?

10:43.290 --> 10:45.290
Yikes! Here comes trouble!

10:45.290 --> 10:46.170
This is bad!

10:58.330 --> 10:59.580
There's a hole!

10:59.920 --> 11:01.170
I can fit inside.

11:01.170 --> 11:02.380
Toodles!

11:04.040 --> 11:05.540
It's pitch-black.

11:05.540 --> 11:07.000
This place is so gloomy, I hate it.

11:07.000 --> 11:11.670
Well, it's still better than the
tainted lands of the demon realm.

11:12.130 --> 11:14.790
Anyways, I need to hurry
and get in touch with Ista.

11:15.330 --> 11:17.170
Oh no! My tumbler is gone!

11:17.170 --> 11:18.580
It had hot coffee in it!

11:18.580 --> 11:20.330
I must have dropped it earlier!

11:20.330 --> 11:22.830
Argh! This is turning into a disaster!

11:24.290 --> 11:27.210
No way around it.
I'll just have to go back to the town.

11:27.210 --> 11:29.790
Spy item: Night Vision Glasses.

11:29.790 --> 11:32.210
They give the user clear sight
even in dark areas.

11:32.210 --> 11:36.250
However, Asta's eyes are good enough
that she can read books in the dark,

11:36.250 --> 11:37.460
so they serve no purpose.

11:37.460 --> 11:39.580
It's purely a psychological thing.

11:39.790 --> 11:42.580
Based on how the air is flowing,
the exit should be...

11:42.580 --> 11:43.670
this way.

11:44.250 --> 11:45.290
Whoa.

11:47.330 --> 11:49.040
I feel a light breeze here.

11:49.250 --> 11:51.250
There must be a tiny gap in the wall...

11:53.290 --> 11:54.670
I knew it!

11:57.420 --> 11:59.330
It's so heavy in the middle!

12:04.130 --> 12:05.500
A library?

12:05.500 --> 12:07.630
What is this doing here?

12:11.500 --> 12:13.420
That book seems kind of suspicious.

12:14.210 --> 12:15.540
Let's take a look.

12:16.210 --> 12:22.540
"By using its power... and shall revive...
for our Kingdom..."

12:23.000 --> 12:24.080
Alrighty.

12:24.080 --> 12:26.420
This book is so old and battered
it's unreadable.

12:26.420 --> 12:28.670
But it looks like there's a bunch
of good stuff in here.

12:31.580 --> 12:33.790
This must be the regular entrance.

12:34.170 --> 12:36.580
I guess this really is
some kind of secret room.

12:36.920 --> 12:37.830
Nice!

12:37.830 --> 12:40.040
Now I have a place to hide
in an emergency.

12:43.210 --> 12:45.710
Whoa! I've never seen this area before.

12:45.710 --> 12:47.830
I wonder where it connects to.

12:50.580 --> 12:51.330
Hey!

12:51.330 --> 12:54.080
Don't make loud noises like that!
I don't want to draw any attenti-

12:57.290 --> 12:58.170
Crap!

12:58.500 --> 12:59.580
Somebody's coming!

12:59.580 --> 13:02.290
Okay, I guess now is the time
to use this secret room.

13:04.710 --> 13:06.080
It's not opening!

13:06.080 --> 13:08.290
Hey! What's the big idea?!

13:08.290 --> 13:10.080
Let me in, darn it!

13:12.540 --> 13:14.880
My work here isn't done yet.

13:14.880 --> 13:16.330
But I've gotta run for now!

13:29.790 --> 13:31.080
This sucks.

13:31.080 --> 13:33.040
There aren't any good places
to stay hidden around here!

13:33.040 --> 13:34.580
And there are so many guards!

13:34.580 --> 13:36.630
Not to mention the hallway
just goes straight!

13:36.630 --> 13:38.380
This is so risky!

13:39.830 --> 13:41.670
S-something is coming this way...

13:44.000 --> 13:45.580
Wh-what should I do?

14:45.330 --> 14:46.790
That was a close call.

14:46.790 --> 14:50.710
Did he notice the slight change in the
airflow from when I opened the window?

14:50.960 --> 14:53.250
Not just anybody could do that.

14:53.250 --> 14:57.080
Spy item: Compactable Cat Claws.

14:57.080 --> 14:59.420
They are designed
to help the user scale walls.

14:59.420 --> 15:03.460
However, Asta is perfectly capable of
climbing walls using only her bare hands.

15:03.460 --> 15:05.250
It's purely a psychological thing.

15:09.080 --> 15:10.290
I've got no choice.

15:10.580 --> 15:12.630
I need to go back in
through a different window.

15:27.460 --> 15:28.750
Whoopsies!

15:34.000 --> 15:35.580
Oh, crap! Oh, crap!

15:36.750 --> 15:38.670
Wait, this one is open.

15:39.130 --> 15:40.960
And I don't see anyone around.

15:41.290 --> 15:42.330
Go!

15:48.210 --> 15:49.500
Is that a room?

15:52.130 --> 15:54.380
Hey there, boy. What are you doing?

15:54.380 --> 15:55.500
Dammit!

15:55.880 --> 15:57.920
I was in such a rush
that I didn't notice her!

15:59.750 --> 16:01.960
Hey, boy. Did you hear me?

16:01.960 --> 16:03.040
Huh?

16:03.710 --> 16:07.130
What's with this girl?
She doesn't have her guard up.

16:07.130 --> 16:09.420
But then, why is she so calm?

16:09.710 --> 16:11.920
She must be super strong or something.

16:12.170 --> 16:15.380
Can you speak?
What are you doing in my room?

16:15.380 --> 16:17.040
Well, um, ya see!

16:17.040 --> 16:18.710
I-I'm a traveling merchant
from another country!

16:18.710 --> 16:21.080
I kinda lost my way and then
suddenly found myself here!

16:23.080 --> 16:25.080
Well, it was worth a shot.

16:25.920 --> 16:26.880
Yeah?

16:26.880 --> 16:29.790
Pretty crazy how you came so far
with all the guards around.

16:29.790 --> 16:31.000
U-uh, yeah.

16:31.000 --> 16:33.580
The winged people
kind of freaked me out...

16:33.580 --> 16:36.500
and this is where I ended up
after running away to avoid them.

16:36.500 --> 16:39.750
Ah, I can totally relate to that.
They are pretty creepy, huh?

16:40.170 --> 16:42.040
I guess that convinced her...

16:42.500 --> 16:43.380
So, hey.

16:43.380 --> 16:46.210
If you're a traveling merchant,
then what country are you from?

16:46.210 --> 16:48.500
I don't know about any places
beyond this kingdom.

16:48.500 --> 16:51.500
What kind of country is it?
And what kind of people does it have?

16:51.790 --> 16:55.830
H-has she seriously not noticed
that I'm from the demon realm?

16:55.830 --> 16:56.250
What kind of goods do you sell, boy?

16:56.250 --> 16:58.420
She doesn't seem suspicious of me at all.
What kind of goods do you sell, boy?<b></b>

16:58.420 --> 17:00.040
No way, this has to be a trick.
Do you have anything cool or interesting?<b></b>

17:00.920 --> 17:04.170
S-sorry! But I really need to get going...

17:04.420 --> 17:06.670
Wait. Will you talk to me
for a little bit?

17:07.330 --> 17:11.130
To be honest, I've been trapped
up here for a long time now.

17:11.130 --> 17:14.580
And I haven't been able to
